  "population_rule": "Experiment C1 only: 16 traced SQLite relaxed main trials at one assigned delay (2.25 s) in two conditions - 8 C1-control (the frozen frontend closes the original IDBDatabase after the ACK, `connection=closed`, exactly as in paper3v2_mechanism_b1) and 8 C1-test (the frozen frontend retains the original IDBDatabase and never calls close(), `connection=held`). Both conditions share one workload, one oracle, one guest and one identical tracing pipeline; the only difference is the connection lifecycle. These traced trials are a separate population and are never pooled with paper3v2, paper3v2_mechanism (Experiment A) or paper3v2_mechanism_b1. No replacement or retry of a classified trial; a recovery, trace or timing failure is never counted as a loss. A slot interrupted before classification may be re-run once from a fresh overlay with the interruption recorded."
